# structured review JSON -> markdown comment body
"### AI review (advisory, not a required check)\n\n**Verdict:** `\(.verdict)`\n\n\(.summary)\n\n"
+ ( [.findings[] | "- **\(.severity)** `\(.file)\(if .line then ":\(.line)" else "" end)`: \(.issue)"] | join("\n") )
+ "\n\n_Generated by a model from the PR diff. A code owner still has to review this PR._"
